ADDITIONAL NOTICE - SAFETY CRITICAL HARDWARE

This repository describes hardware that fires pyrotechnic igniters and
restrains solid rocket motors under thrust. The MIT licence above grants
permission to use and modify these files. It grants no assurance that the
design is safe, complete, correct, or fit for any purpose.

Anyone building or operating this hardware is solely responsible for their
own safety review, for compliance with applicable law, and for compliance
with the safety codes of their national rocketry association.
